<p>Your library is a private collection of outfits you chose to keep, stored in your browser.</p>
<h2>Saving</h2>
<p>Use the bookmark on an outfit. Each entry embeds the item data as it was when you saved it, so clearing the cache never damages it.</p>
<h2>Organising</h2>
<ul><li>Group outfits into collections.</li><li>Add tags and notes.</li><li>Each card shows a strip of its items.</li></ul>
<h2>Backing up and moving</h2>
<p>Export from Settings as a JSON file, and import it in another browser. RoFit checks the file’s format before importing. The file stays wherever you put it; RoFit doesn’t upload it.</p>
<h2>Erasing</h2>
<p>Settings → Privacy &amp; storage can delete the library and the cache. Removing the extension deletes everything it stored.</p>
